{"id":"69f05fbc485387cb","group":"27","path":"27/27-ex-missingquantifiers.md","title":"Strict differences between extension quantifiers","display":"ex-missingquantifiers — Strict differences between extension quantifiers","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-ex-missingquantifiers","aliases":["27-ex-missingquantifiers"],"display":"ex-missingquantifiers — Strict differences between extension quantifiers","depends_on":["[[27-df-missingextensions]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§12.5.1, Remark 12.3; local examples","source_printed_pages":"553–554","source_pdf_pages":"577–578","verification_status":"source-background-checked-and-local-witnesses-proved"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-ex-missingquantifiers"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-ex-missingquantifiers</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-missingquantifiers — Strict differences between extension quantifiers"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" href=\"?note=ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" title=\"27-df-missingextensions\">27-df-missingextensions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§12.5.1, Remark 12.3; local examples"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"553–554"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"577–578"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-background-checked-and-local-witnesses-proved"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F)\\in\\mathrm{pBmb}_n\">\\((\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F)\\in\\mathrm{pBmb}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\)</span>；扩张语义见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" href=\"?note=ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" title=\"27-df-missingextensions\">27-df-missingextensions</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g,h\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1\">\\(g,h\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K_1\">\\(\\mathcal K_1\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FRE}_n,\\mathrm{CE}_n,\\mathrm{FCE}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{FRE}_n,\\mathrm{CE}_n,\\mathrm{FCE}_n\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" href=\"?note=ed82ee57f6aa99b2\" title=\"27-df-missingextensions\">27-df-missingextensions</a> 的精确接口。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{FCE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{CE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{FCE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{CE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"g\\coloneqq\\{((0),0),((1),1)\\},\\qquad h\\coloneqq\\{((0),1),((1),0)\\},\\qquad\\mathcal K_1\\coloneqq\\{g,h\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[g\\coloneqq\\{((0),0),((1),1)\\},\\qquad h\\coloneqq\\{((0),1),((1),0)\\},\\qquad\\mathcal K_1\\coloneqq\\{g,h\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FCE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\emptyset;\\mathcal K_1)\\land\\mathrm{FRE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\emptyset;\\mathcal K_1)=\\emptyset.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FCE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\emptyset;\\mathcal K_1)\\land\\mathrm{FRE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\emptyset;\\mathcal K_1)=\\emptyset.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\{(0)\\};\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1)\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\neg\\mathrm{FCE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\{(0)\\};\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{CE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\{(0)\\};\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1)\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\neg\\mathrm{FCE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\{(0)\\};\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源背景：§12.5.1 与 Remark 12.3，印刷页 553–554 / PDF 第 577–578 页；这两个具体见证是本地补充例子，不冒充原书编号例题。全赋值集合非空，所以前两蕴含由量词次序直接得到。第一例中，正样本完成为 0 时选 h、完成为 1 时选 g；但二者都不能在 0、1 上恒为 1。第二例中，取正样本完成为 1，可用 g；若完成为 0，则同一点被要求取 1 和 0，任何函数都失败。见证已经完整给出，说明完全稳健、完全一致、一致三种语义严格不同。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-missingextensions","status":"resolved","id":"ed82ee57f6aa99b2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-missingextensions]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-missingextensions","status":"resolved","id":"ed82ee57f6aa99b2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F)\\in\\mathrm{pBmb}_n$，$\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n$；扩张语义见 [[27-df-missingextensions]]。$g,h\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1$、$\\mathcal K_1$ 由下式定义。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-missingextensions","status":"resolved","id":"ed82ee57f6aa99b2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FRE}_n,\\mathrm{CE}_n,\\mathrm{FCE}_n$ 使用 [[27-df-missingextensions]] 的精确接口。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F)\\in\\mathrm{pBmb}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"g,h\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal K_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FRE}_n,\\mathrm{CE}_n,\\mathrm{FCE}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FRE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{FCE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\\mathrm{CE}_n(\\widetilde T,\\widetilde F;\\mathcal K)\\ne\\emptyset.","display":true},{"tex":"g\\coloneqq\\{((0),0),((1),1)\\},\\qquad h\\coloneqq\\{((0),1),((1),0)\\},\\qquad\\mathcal K_1\\coloneqq\\{g,h\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{FCE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\emptyset;\\mathcal K_1)\\land\\mathrm{FRE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\emptyset;\\mathcal K_1)=\\emptyset.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\{(0)\\};\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1)\\ne\\emptyset\\land\\neg\\mathrm{FCE}_1(\\{(\\ast)\\},\\{(0)\\};\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_1).","display":true}],"bytes":2329,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-595","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-ex-missingquantifiers|ex-missingquantifiers — Strict differences between extension quantifiers]]"}],"outgoing":["ed82ee57f6aa99b2"]}